{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01584","headline":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第十八拍 · 刘商","name":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第十八拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归来故乡见亲族，田园半芜春草绿。\n明烛重然煨烬灰，寒泉更洗沈泥玉。\n载持巾栉礼仪好，一弄丝桐生死足。\n出入关山十二年，哀情尽在胡笳曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}